  "details": "Ever since the EAC update (which I think is a good update by the way people are drama queens), whenever I try to join the RP lobbies I used to play in in VR,  I see a quick flash of parts of the map as pink untextured and then I am booted to the Home world instantly.\nI've updated my graphics drivers etc and tried fresh installs of both SteamVR and VRChat.\nMy system isn't terribly powerful but for perspective, I used to average 20 FPS in these lobbies with 40-60 players present in the world. Now I am kicked to Home even if only 6 people are in the instance when I join. It has made the game quite literally unplayable for me.",
